        "content": "That's great, thank you! I'm glad to hear the opportunity is set up. Since I'm not creating a new lead record, just this referral opportunity, does the system automatically generate a new contact or account for the person I'm referring, or do I need to manually create their profile first? I want to make sure I have the right process down before I start sharing the details with my team."
